<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC sets ecology-friendly investment funds.</title>
<headline>SBC sets ecology-friendly investment funds.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp said it was launching two investment funds that focus on companies with high financial and ecological performance.</p>
<p>Units of Luxembourg-based &quot;SBC Eco Performance Portfolio - World Equities&quot; are on sale until June 13 and are priced at 500 Swiss francs plus charges. Pay date is June 18.</p>
<p>SBC's investment foundation AST is also launching an investment group called &quot;Aktien Welt Oeko-Performance&quot;, SBC said in a statement. Units are priced at 1,000 francs. The initial offer period ends on June 13.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
